{'symbol': 'EA', 'date': '2021-11-17 10:01:00', 'title': 'ELECTRONIC ARTS REVEALS NEW MADDEN NFL 22 DIGITAL COVER FEATURING BO JACKSON IN A THROWBACK TO THE ICONIC NIKE BO KNOWS CAMPAIGN', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, ELECTRONIC ARTS REVEALED A NEW DIGITAL COVER OF EA SPORTS™ MADDEN NFL 22 FOR THE HOLIDAY SEASON THAT FEATURES LEGENDARY MULTI-SPORT ATHLETE BO JACKSON ON HIS FIRST COVER, AND REIGNITES 90S NOSTALGIA FOR THE ICONIC NIKE BO KNOWS CAMPAIGN. STARTING NOVEMBER 19 IN MADDEN NFL 22, PLAYERS CAN EXPLORE BO JACKSON'S FOOTBALL LEGACY WITH NEW EXPERIENCES AND CONTENT ACROSS SOME OF THE GAME'S MOST POPULAR MODES INCLUDING ULTIMATE TEAM, THE YARD, AND SUPERSTAR"}